[h2]Build 0.9.34[/h2]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*]When a Loader leaves an item on the belt because something still needs it, it now names the machine and the bill asking for it, what the bill wants and how many are still missing, e.g. [i]Electric smelter still needs it for bill "Smelt metal from slag", which wants steel (20 of 50 still missing)[/i]. Storage at the end of a line says that its storage settings accept the item and how much room is left.
[/list]
